@startuml
title Campus Food Ordering System — Use Cases DRAFT
left to right direction

actor Visitor
actor Student
actor Merchant
actor Administrator

rectangle "Campus Food Ordering System" {
  usecase "Browse merchants and menus" as UC_Browse
  usecase "Search and filter items" as UC_Search
  usecase "Manage cart" as UC_Cart
  usecase "Register student account" as UC_Register
  usecase "Sign in by role" as UC_Login
  usecase "Submit multi-merchant order" as UC_Submit
  usecase "View own order and suborders" as UC_ViewOrder
  usecase "Manage own catalog and categories" as UC_Catalog
  usecase "Set or edit fixed discount" as UC_Discount
  usecase "View and update own suborders" as UC_Suborders
  usecase "Create and manage merchant accounts" as UC_Merchants
  usecase "Create administrator account" as UC_Admins
}

Visitor --> UC_Browse
Visitor --> UC_Search
Visitor --> UC_Cart
Visitor --> UC_Register
Student --> UC_Browse
Student --> UC_Search
Student --> UC_Cart
Student --> UC_Submit
Student --> UC_ViewOrder
Student --> UC_Login
Merchant --> UC_Catalog
Merchant --> UC_Discount
Merchant --> UC_Suborders
Merchant --> UC_Login
Administrator --> UC_Merchants
Administrator --> UC_Admins
Administrator --> UC_Login

note bottom of UC_Browse
  Requirements: FR-03, FR-04, FR-05
end note
note bottom of UC_Cart
  Requirements: FR-11, FR-12, FR-13, FR-14, FR-15
end note
note bottom of UC_Register
  Requirements: FR-01
  Registration fields are student number, nickname and password. Student number is unique.
end note
note bottom of UC_Login
  Requirements: FR-01, FR-32
  Student, merchant and administrator use separate sign-in screens.
  Student sign-in uses student number and password.
end note
note bottom of UC_Submit
  Requirements: FR-16–FR-25
end note
note bottom of UC_ViewOrder
  Requirements: FR-26, FR-28–FR-30, FR-33
  Student sees aggregate status and groups visible suborder IDs by status.
  Merchant sees only own suborders and their status groups, without aggregate status.
end note
note bottom of UC_Catalog
  Requirements: FR-06–FR-11
end note
note bottom of UC_Discount
  Requirements: FR-20, FR-23, FR-28
  Pricing uses the formulas in FR-19 to FR-21.
end note
note bottom of UC_Suborders
  Requirements: FR-26–FR-30
end note
note bottom of UC_Merchants
  Requirements: FR-02
end note
note bottom of UC_Admins
  Requirements: FR-02
end note

note bottom of "Campus Food Ordering System"
  Requirements: NFR-01, FR-18, FR-31
  This version is a web application. Amounts use integer New Taiwan dollars.
  Payment scope is limited to displaying amounts. Online payment and payment-status flows are out of scope.
end note

@enduml
